231|Absolutely.|
232|Financial stability is important,|
233|and our career choices also depend|
234|on our situation.|
235|By the way, Léa,|
236|if money weren't a problem at all,|
237|what job would you like to try?|
238|Hmm... I think I'd like to work|e=question
239|in a small publishing house.|
240|Ah, that suits you well.|e=coeur
241|You love books.|i=lecture:les livres
242|Yes. I'd like to discover new authors,|
243|talk about their stories|
244|and help create beautiful books.|
245|I can picture you perfectly|
246|in an office full of books,|
247|with a big window and a cup of tea.|
248|Exactly! And you?|
249|Me, I'd like to create a show|
250|about travel|i=voyage:les voyages
251|and culinary traditions.|
252|Food again!|e=rire
253|But this time, I'm serious!|
254|I'd like to meet people,|
255|listen to their stories and discover|
