259|travelling, communicating|
260|and discovering new cultures.|
261|Exactly. But in reality,|
262|this kind of work takes time,|
263|resources and a lot of organisation.|
264|That's why you have to find a balance|
265|between your wishes and your material needs.|
266|And sometimes, a job|
